<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0673_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Torin</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0673_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You know, I’m finna practice a whole\nbunch so we can scrap again next\ftime we meet.\rThat’s right! Gimme your phone\nnumber so I can call you! {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0673_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Aight, you saved!\nLater!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0673_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">That’s too bad...</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0673_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ayo! You REALLY wanna swap\nnumbers with me, don’t you? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0673_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Huh?\nI can hear a windmill...\rThat mean you nearby,\nain’t you?\rSo come talk for real!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0673_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">My {STRVAR_1 0, 10, 0} go HARD!\rEverything I learn at school, it help\nme repeat it right away.\rYour homies listen to what you say?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0673_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Yesterday we scrapped a {STRVAR_1 0, 11, 0}!\rWe practiced all the stuff I learned\nin school!\rWhere you go to school?\nFr, you don’t go to my school?\fThat can’t be true, can it?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0673_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Recently I was tryna catch a\n{STRVAR_1 0, 11, 0}, but it dipped!\fSO disappointin’!\rSo I don’t forget how disappointin’\nit was, I’m writin’ the name of the\fhomie that got away in my notebook.\rThere’s homie names ALL over\nmy notebook!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0673_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ayo, come scrap me again.\nI’ll be waitin’ at {STRVAR_1 4, 3, 0}!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0673_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Wassup? I’m at {STRVAR_1 4, 3, 0}. We\nwas finna scrap, wasn’t we?\fHurry up!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0673_00011" index="11">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Huh? The only time you ever see me is\nwhen I’m walkin’ home from school?\rI guess you right...\rBut when I’m walkin’ TO school, I’m\nalways rushin’ so I ain’t late.\rI ain’t got no time for\nscraps then!</language>
	</row>
</body>
